// Instance 4 is a larger network in the setting of case study 2 of Van
// Roy et al. (not from the paper): 50 stores two, three or four days
// from the warehouse, with the production and warehouse capacities
// scaled with the number of stores. The system starts with 2300 goods
// at the warehouse, 22 at each store, and nothing on the road.

